.claude/settings.local.json
.scratch/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The build writes thousands of JSON files under site/data. Ignore them, and
# keep two. The manifest records every change in the official numbers. The
# heartbeat records the date of every run, and its commit keeps the repository
# active.
#
# Ignore only what the build generates. Everything else under site/ is written
# by hand: the page, the style and the modules of the navigator.
/site/data/*
!/site/data/manifest.json
!/site/data/heartbeat.json
